SUMMARY:Spring Renewal Yoga Series
DESCRIPTION:Exploring movement\, breath and wellness\nThis introductory 4-week yoga series explores whole body care with movement\, breath and mindfulness\, providing new energy\, peace and wellness for your body and spirit. \nMay 7 | Foundations of yoga for new and returning students \nMay14 | Whole body care\, breathwork and nervous system awareness \nMay 21 | Embodied spirituality and our daily lives \nMay 28 | Yoga practices integration and sound meditation \nScholarships available. Click here to email Sarah Shelton \nClick here to register
