SUMMARY:Growing in Faith at Saint James
DESCRIPTION:For those exploring Confirmation and/or Membership \nJoin us on this day for two opportunities to deepen one’s spiritual growth at Saint James and the Urban Well. The day will begin with a shared meal between youth contemplating confirmation and adults exploring membership. Both groups will meet with clergy and share their faith journeys while discussing Church history and its impact on our present practices. There will also be a tour of our beautiful campus. Come and discover what it means to be a member of this vibrant community! Click here to visit our membership page for more information and registration.
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/growing-in-faith-at-saint-james/
LOCATION:Saint James Parish House\, 119 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
